点随着镜头后撤逐步拉远，最终清晰落在中后C位的人物3身上。 阴天全域柔光下，整个空间层次被彻底打开，厚重沉静氛围拉满。 分镜4｜00:9-00:12 大全景落幅・全员定格 镜头完全拉远，定格为三人全员同框大全景。 人物1、人物2分坐前景与中景的行脚折凳或旧木马扎，彼此之间保持自然间距，姿态克制、不刻意摆pose，仅靠眼神与空间关系形成张力。 人物3站于中后位置，手持九齿钉耙，作为最终压轴角色。 背景为荒废山间古驿寺前院、残墙、断裂石阶、石灯、风化佛龛、荒山、枯树与阴云天空，整体构图像一张静止的东方超现实史诗电影海报。 画面最终静止定格，全程无BGM，仅保留风声、衣物摩擦、佛珠轻碰与山间空旷回声。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1536.9329833984375, 5974.28759765625], "id": 138, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 13}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.47.11", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [1786.097678651564, -3931.7343666507577], "scale": 0.450000000000003}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Models", "bounding": [-1520, 4840, 700, 670]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "Sampling", "bounding": [-280, 4840, 690, 670]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "Conditioning", "bounding": [-790, 4840, 480, 670]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "Decoding and create video", "bounding": [440, 4840, 670, 670]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "User Inputs", "bounding": [-1520, 5540, 1930, 900]}], "links": [[250, 120, 0, 121, 1, "VAE"], [251, 119, 0, 122, 1, "VAE"], [253, 129, 0, 125, 0, "NOISE"], [254, 126, 0, 125, 1, "GUIDER"], [255, 123, 0, 125, 2, "SAMPLER"], [256, 124, 0, 125, 3, "SIGMAS"], [258, 122, 0, 130, 0, "IMAGE"], [259, 121, 0, 130, 1, "AUDIO"], [260, 130, 0, 92, 0, "VIDEO"], [261, 132, 0, 131, 0, "FLOAT"], [270, 13